# Several files downloaded at once (DriveScreen.kt openChosenSheet: 下载 n 个文件), one of them 48 MB read a part at a
# time, how far it has come on its row (DownloadChip) meanwhile: each kept, each said. (A folder of their own,
# drive-big: no row there says how far it was read.)
#before drive-big {T}
#env MBUI_OPEN_PAGE=files
timeout 90000
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 大文件
tap =大文件
until 大文件.bin
wait 500
hold 900 大文件.bin
until 已选 1 项
tap 附件.txt
until 已选 2 项
tap icon:more
until 下载 2 个文件
shot 1-sheet
tap 下载 2 个文件
until %
shot 2-going
timeout 180000
gone %
until 已保存到「下载」
wait 3000
shot 3-saved
